---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Case Studies" description="Three complete systems I owned: a data platform with CDC and warehouse consolidation, a segmentation engine for non-technical users, and a real-time recommendation system serving multiple regions.">
  <section style="padding: 52px 0;">
    <h1 style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 40px;">Case Studies</h1>
    <div style="display: grid; gap: 24px;">
      <a href="/case-studies/data-platform" style="text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 24px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--rule-2); border-radius: 4px; transition: border-color 0.2s ease;" class="case-link">
        <div style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;">01</div>
        <h2 style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink);">The Data Platform</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;">Rebuilt how customer and order data flows through the company — from data arriving days late to sub-minute freshness, across 200+ merchant stores on five e-commerce platforms.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;">
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">days → sub-minute</span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">200+ stores</span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">5 e-commerce platforms</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/case-studies/segmentation" style="text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 24px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--rule-2); border-radius: 4px; transition: border-color 0.2s ease;" class="case-link">
        <div style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;">02</div>
        <h2 style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink);">Customer Segmentation</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;">Built the system that lets a non-technical Customer Success rep build audiences without writing a line of code. The module every marketing campaign ran through.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;">
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">4 source systems, 1 query</span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">built on the platform ↑</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/case-studies/recommendations" style="text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 24px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--rule-2); border-radius: 4px; transition: border-color 0.2s ease;" class="case-link">
        <div style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;">03</div>
        <h2 style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink);">Recommendation Blocks</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;">Built the company's product recommendation feature from nothing, designed so store owners could trust it enough to turn it on. Most clients who tried it ended up on the fully automated version.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;">
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">80%+ adoption, Smart tier</span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">5 regions</span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">built on the platform ↑</span>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a href="/case-studies/hard-problems" style="text-decoration: none; display: block; padding: 24px; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--rule-2); border-radius: 4px; transition: border-color 0.2s ease;" class="case-link">
        <div style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; color: var(--ink-3); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px;">04</div>
        <h2 style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--ink);">Hard Problems</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-2); line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 12px;">Eight production incidents that shaped engineering judgment. Lock contention at scale, silent failures, architectural incompatibility, leadership under crisis.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;">
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">query architecture</span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">scale constraints</span>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--ink-3); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 3px;">systematic patterns</span>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .case-link:hover {
    border-color: var(--accent);
  }
  .case-link:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }
</style>
